msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/classes.rst:1977
msgid ""
"The :ref:`ref-classes-own-mirrors` class makes it easier to set up your "
"own :term:`PREMIRRORS` from which to first fetch source before attempting"
" to fetch it from the upstream specified in :term:`SRC_URI` within each "
"recipe."
