msgid "``package_deb``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/classes.rst:2050
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The :ref:`ref-classes-package_deb` class provides support for creating "
"packages that use the Debian (i.e. ``.deb``) file format. The class "
"ensures the packages are written out in a ``.deb`` file format to the "
"``${``\\ :term:`DEPLOY_DIR_DEB`\\ ``}`` directory."
msgstr ""

