#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You should set :term:`SYSTEMD_SERVICE` to the name of the service file. "
"You should also use a package name override to indicate the package to "
"which the value applies. If the value applies to the recipe's main "
"package, use ``${``\\ :term:`PN`\\ ``}``. Here is an example from the "
"connman recipe::"
msgstr ""

