"separate terminal session needs to be started. For example, the :ref"
":`ref-classes-patch` class assuming :term:`PATCHRESOLVE` is set to "
"\"user\", the :ref:`ref-classes-cml1` class, and the :ref:`ref-classes-"
"devshell` class all use the :ref:`ref-classes-terminal` class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/classes.rst:3124
msgid "``testexport``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/classes.rst:3126
