#: ../../ref-manual/classes.rst:3159
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you wish to have tests automatically run for each image"
" after it is built, you can set :term:`TESTIMAGE_AUTO`::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/classes.rst:3164
