":term:`BUILD_CC`, :term:`BUILD_CXX` and other such variables which are "
"rarely used in recipes. Exception be made for target recipes that need to"
" use the compiler from the build host at some point during the build."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/classes.rst:3262
msgid ""
