":`ref-classes-base` class if :term:`TOOLCHAIN_NATIVE` is set to "
"\"clang\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/classes.rst:3268
msgid "``toolchain/gcc``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/classes.rst:3270
msgid ""
"The :ref:`ref-classes-toolchain-gcc` class defines commands for building "
"recipes with GCC/Binutils compiler and utilities."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/classes.rst:3275
msgid ""
"set the :term:`PREFERRED_TOOLCHAIN_TARGET`, "
