#: ../../ref-manual/faq.rst:196
msgid ""
"The build system also accepts ``http_proxy``, ``ftp_proxy``, "
"``https_proxy``, and ``all_proxy`` set as to standard shell environment "
"variables to redirect requests through proxy servers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/faq.rst:200
msgid ""
"The Yocto Project also includes a "
":oecore_path:`meta/conf/templates/default/site.conf.sample` file that "
"shows how to configure a Git proxy server if needed."
