#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:101
msgid "Distro Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:103
msgid ""
"The items below are features you can use with :term:`DISTRO_FEATURES` to "
"enable features across your distribution. Features do not have a one-to-"
"one correspondence to packages, and they can go beyond simply controlling"
" the installation of a package or packages. In most cases, the presence "
"or absence of a feature translates to the appropriate option supplied to "
"the configure script during the :ref:`ref-tasks-configure` task for the "
"recipes that optionally support the feature. Appropriate options must be "
"supplied, and enabling/disabling :term:`PACKAGECONFIG` for the concerned "
"packages is one way of supplying such options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:114
msgid ""
"Some distro features are also machine features. These select features "
"make sense to be controlled both at the machine and distribution "
"configuration level. See the :term:`COMBINED_FEATURES` variable for more "
"information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:122
msgid ""
":term:`DISTRO_FEATURES` is normally independent of kernel configuration, "
"so if a feature specified in :term:`DISTRO_FEATURES` also relies on "
"support in the kernel, you will also need to ensure that support is "
"enabled in the kernel configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:127
msgid ""
"This list only represents features as shipped with the Yocto Project "
"metadata, as extra layers can define their own:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:130
msgid "*3g:* Include support for cellular data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:132
msgid ""
"*acl:* Include :wikipedia:`Access Control List <Access-control_list>` "
"support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:134
msgid ""
"*alsa:* Include :wikipedia:`Advanced Linux Sound Architecture "
"<Advanced_Linux_Sound_Architecture>` support (OSS compatibility kernel "
"modules installed if available)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:137
msgid ""
