"the ``bitbake -c populate_sdk`` command is used. See the \":ref:`sdk-"
"manual/appendix-customizing-standard:adding api documentation to the "
"standard sdk`\" section in the Yocto Project Application Development and "
"the Extensible Software Development Kit (eSDK) manual."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:144
