"server method>` server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:160
msgid "*directfb:* Include DirectFB support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:162
msgid ""
"*ext2:* Include tools for supporting devices with internal HDD/Microdrive"
" for storing files (instead of Flash only devices)."
