msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:177
msgid ""
"*minidebuginfo:* Add minimal debug symbols :ref:`(minidebuginfo)<dev-"
"manual/debugging:enabling minidebuginfo>` to binary files containing, "
