"Sometimes it is necessary in the :term:`OpenEmbedded Build System` to add"
" new functionality to :term:`MACHINE_FEATURES` or "
":term:`DISTRO_FEATURES`, but at the same time, allow existing "
"distributions or machine definitions to opt out of such new features, to "
"retain the same overall level of functionality."
