#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:456
msgid ""
"To make this possible, the OpenEmbedded build system provides a default "
"list of features through the :term:`DISTRO_FEATURES_DEFAULTS` and "
":term:`MACHINE_FEATURES_DEFAULTS` variables. You can see the default "
"definition of these variable in the "
":oecore_path:`meta/conf/distro/include/default-distrovars.inc` and "
":oecore_path:`meta/conf/bitbake.conf` files."
