msgid ""
"The :term:`DISTRO_FEATURES_OPTED_OUT` and "
":term:`MACHINE_FEATURES_OPTED_OUT` variables can be used to remove a "
"feature provided by one of the :term:`DISTRO_FEATURES_DEFAULTS` of "
":term:`MACHINE_FEATURES_DEFAULTS` variables."
