"value of :term:`DISTRO_FEATURES`, but not feature ``b``. This also "
"applies for :term:`MACHINE_FEATURES_DEFAULTS` and "
":term:`MACHINE_FEATURES_OPTED_OUT`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/features.rst:480
msgid ""
"You can also opt out of all default features by setting "
":term:`DISTRO_FEATURES_OPTED_OUT` or :term:`MACHINE_FEATURES_OPTED_OUT` "
