"The :ref:`ref-bitbake-config-build-show-fragment` command is used to show"
" the location and value of a fragment. For example, running ``bitbake-"
"config-build show-fragment core/yocto/sstate-mirror-cdn`` will show the "
"content of the :ref:`ref-fragments-core-yocto-sstate-mirror-cdn` "
"fragment."
