#: ../../ref-manual/fragments.rst:160
msgid "``machine/``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/fragments.rst:162
msgid ""
"The ``machine/`` :term:`built-in fragment` can be used to assign the "
"value of the :term:`MACHINE` variable globally."
