msgid ""
"This check ensures that the shebang line (``#!`` in the first line) for a"
" script is not longer than 128 characters, which can cause an error at "
"runtime depending on the operating system. If you are seeing this message"
" then the specified script may need to be patched to have a shorter in "
"order to avoid runtime problems."
