"recipe has been renamed. However, if that is not the case, the message "
"might indicate that a private version of a library is being erroneously "
"picked up as the provider for a common library. If that is the case, you "
"should add the library's ``.so`` filename to :term:`PRIVATE_LIBS` in the "
"recipe that provides the private version of the library."
