"manual/concepts:shared state cache>`) cache, and downloaded source files "
"for a target (i.e. the contents of :term:`DL_DIR`). Essentially, the :ref"
":`ref-tasks-cleanall` task is identical to the :ref:`ref-tasks-"
"cleansstate` task with the added removal of downloaded source files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/tasks.rst:529
msgid ""
"You should never use the :ref:`ref-tasks-cleanall` task in a normal "
"scenario. If you want to start fresh with the :ref:`ref-tasks-fetch` "
"task, use instead::"
