msgid ""
"because after step 1 there is a stamp file for the :ref:`ref-tasks-fetch`"
" task of ``recipe``, and it won't be removed at step 2 because step 2 "
"uses a different work directory. So the unpack task at step 3 will try to"
" extract the downloaded archive and fail as it has been deleted in step "
"2."
