#: ../../ref-manual/tasks.rst:558
msgid ""
"Removes all output files and shared state (:ref:`sstate <overview-"
"manual/concepts:shared state cache>`) cache for a target. Essentially, "
"the :ref:`ref-tasks-cleansstate` task is identical to the :ref:`ref-"
"tasks-clean` task with the added removal of shared state (:ref:`sstate "
"<overview-manual/concepts:shared state cache>`) cache."
