msgid ""
"The reliable and preferred way to force a new build is to use ``bitbake "
"-f`` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/tasks.rst:587
msgid ""
"The :ref:`ref-tasks-cleansstate` task cannot remove sstate from a remote "
"sstate mirror. If you need to build a target from scratch using remote "
"mirrors, use the \"-f\" option as follows::"
