"individually, and also there is a ``meta/conf/distro/include/no-static-"
"libs.inc`` include file that disables static linking for a number of "
"recipes. Some software packages or build tools (such as CMake) have "
"explicit support for enabling / disabling static linking, and in those "
"cases :term:`DISABLE_STATIC` is not used."
