"to the configure script during the :ref:`ref-tasks-configure` task for "
"recipes that optionally support the feature. For example, specifying "
"\"x11\" in :term:`DISTRO_FEATURES`, causes every piece of software built "
"for the target that can optionally support X11 to have its X11 support "
"enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:2520
