"the ``/var/log/postinstall.log`` file on first boot of the image on the "
"target system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:2943
msgid ""
"\"dev-pkgs\" --- adds -dev packages for all installed packages. This is "
"useful if you want to develop against the libraries in the image."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:2945
