#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3318
msgid ""
"Be aware that the default :term:`FILESPATH` directories do not map to "
"directories in custom layers where append files (``.bbappend``) are used."
" If you want the build system to find patches or files that reside with "
"your append files, you need to extend the :term:`FILESPATH` variable by "
"using the :term:`FILESEXTRAPATHS` variable."
