#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3404
msgid ":term:`FIT_CONF_DEFAULT_DTB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3406
msgid ""
"Specifies the default device tree binary (dtb) file for a FIT image when "
"multiple ones are provided."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3409
msgid "This variable is used in the :ref:`ref-classes-kernel-fit-image` class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3410
msgid ":term:`FIT_CONF_MAPPINGS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3412
msgid ""
"When inheriting the :ref:`ref-classes-kernel-fit-image`, the "
":term:`FIT_CONF_MAPPINGS` variable allows specifying mappings to rename "
"configuration nodes or add extra configuration nodes for existing device "
"tree blobs (DTBs) in FIT images. This provides flexibility when a 1 to 1 "
"mapping between DTB names and configuration node names does not work, "
"such as when the kernel defines a kernel specific name but the bootloader"
" uses a different name. This might be the case when maintaining "
"compatibility with existing boot scripts or bootloader configurations. "
"But there are other use cases as well."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3422
msgid "The variable accepts a space-separated list of mapping commands:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3424
msgid ""
"``dtb-conf:DTB_NAME:NEW_NAME`` Renames the configuration node for a "
"specific DTB. The ``DTB_NAME`` is the name of the DTB without its "
"``.dtb`` suffix."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3428
msgid ""
"``dtb-extra-conf:DTB_NAME:EXTRA_NAME`` Creates an additional "
"configuration node for an existing DTB. This is useful when you need to "
"provide alternative names for the same hardware configuration to maintain"
" compatibility with existing boot scripts or bootloader configurations or"
" just need an alias configuration name for some other reason."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3441
msgid "This generates three configuration nodes from two DTBs:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3443
msgid ""
"``am335x-bonegreen``: the original configuration node for the ``am335x-"
"bonegreen`` device tree"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3445
msgid ""
"``bonegreen``: an extra configuration node for the same ``am335x-"
"bonegreen`` DTB"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3447
msgid "``bbblack``: a renamed configuration node for the ``am335x-boneblack`` DTB"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3449
msgid ""
"The :ref:`ref-classes-kernel-fit-image` class validates all mappings and "
"ensures they match existing DTBs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3451
msgid ":term:`FIT_CONF_PREFIX`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3453
msgid ""
"When using the :ref:`ref-classes-kernel-fit-image`, this is the prefix "
"used for creating FIT configuration nodes. Its default value is "
"\"conf-\"."
msgstr ""

