msgid ":term:`FIT_DESC`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3457
msgid ""
"Specifies the description string encoded into a FIT image. The default "
"value is set by the :ref:`ref-classes-kernel-fit-image` class as "
"follows::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3462
msgid ":term:`FIT_GENERATE_KEYS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3464
msgid ""
"Decides whether to generate the keys for signing the FIT image if they "
"don't already exist. The keys are created in :term:`UBOOT_SIGN_KEYDIR`. "
"The default value is set to \"0\" by the :ref:`ref-classes-kernel-fit-"
"image` class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3468
msgid ":term:`FIT_HASH_ALG`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3470
msgid ""
"Specifies the hash algorithm used in creating the FIT Image. This "
"variable is set by default to \"sha256\" by the :ref:`ref-classes-kernel-"
"fit-image` class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3473
msgid ":term:`FIT_KERNEL_COMP_ALG`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:3475
msgid ""
"The compression algorithm to use for the kernel image inside the FIT "
"Image. At present, the only supported values are \"gzip\" (default), "
"\"lzo\" or \"none\"."
msgstr ""

