msgid ""
"Space-separated list of loadables to add to a FIT image in addition to "
"regular ones (kernel, initramfs, dtsb etc.). Values specified here will "
"be used as node names inside the FIT image; all of them will be included "
"in all configurations by using the ``loadables`` property."
