":term:`FIT_LOADABLE_ENTRYPOINT`, :term:`FIT_LOADABLE_FILENAME`, "
":term:`FIT_LOADABLE_LOADADDRESS`, :term:`FIT_LOADABLE_OS` and "
":term:`FIT_LOADABLE_TYPE`."
