msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:4120
msgid ""
"A space-separated list (filter) of tools on the build host that should be"
" allowed to be called from within build tasks. Using this filter helps "
"reduce the possibility of host contamination. If a tool specified in the "
"value of :term:`HOSTTOOLS` is not found on the build host, the "
"OpenEmbedded build system produces an error and the build is not started."
