msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:4129
msgid ":term:`HOSTTOOLS_NONFATAL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:4131
msgid ""
"A space-separated list (filter) of tools on the build host that should be"
" allowed to be called from within build tasks. Using this filter helps "
"reduce the possibility of host contamination. Unlike :term:`HOSTTOOLS`, "
"the OpenEmbedded build system does not produce an error if a tool "
"specified in the value of :term:`HOSTTOOLS_NONFATAL` is not found on the "
"build host. Thus, you can use :term:`HOSTTOOLS_NONFATAL` to filter "
"optional host tools."
msgstr ""

