#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:5418
msgid ":term:`KERNEL_ALT_IMAGETYPE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:5420
msgid ""
"Specifies an alternate kernel image type for creation in addition to the "
"kernel image type specified using the :term:`KERNEL_IMAGETYPE` and "
":term:`KERNEL_IMAGETYPES` variables."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:5423
msgid ":term:`KERNEL_ARTIFACT_NAME`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:5425
msgid ""
"Specifies the name of all of the build artifacts. You can change the name"
" of the artifacts by changing the :term:`KERNEL_ARTIFACT_NAME` variable."
