#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:5471
msgid ":term:`KERNEL_DEBUG_TIMESTAMPS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:5473
msgid ""
"If set to \"1\", enables timestamping functionality during building the "
"kernel. The default is \"0\" to disable this for reproducibility reasons."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:5476
msgid ":term:`KERNEL_DEPLOY_DEPEND`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:5478
msgid ""
"Provides a means of controlling the dependency of an image recipe on the "
"kernel. The default value is \"virtual/kernel:do_deploy\", however for a "
"small initramfs image or other images that do not need the kernel, this "
"can be set to \"\" in the image recipe."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:5482
msgid ":term:`KERNEL_DEVICETREE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:5484
msgid ""
"Specifies the name of the generated Linux kernel device tree (i.e. the "
"``.dtb``) file."
