msgid ":term:`KERNEL_DTBDEST`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:5531
msgid ""
"This variable, used by the :ref:`ref-classes-kernel-devicetree` class, "
"allows to change the installation directory of the DTB (Device Tree "
"Binary) files."
