#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:5554
msgid ":term:`KERNEL_EXTRA_ARGS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:5556
msgid ""
"Specifies additional ``make`` command-line arguments the OpenEmbedded "
"build system passes on when compiling the kernel."
