msgid ""
"The metadata you add through this variable includes config fragments and "
"features descriptions, which usually includes patches as well as config "
"fragments. You typically override the :term:`KERNEL_FEATURES` variable "
"for a specific machine. In this way, you can provide validated, but "
"optional, sets of kernel configurations and features."
