msgid ""
"You can use the :term:`PACKAGE_FEED_ARCHS` variable to allow specific "
"package architectures. If you do not need to allow specific "
"architectures, which is a common case, you can omit this variable. "
"Omitting the variable results in all available architectures for the "
"current machine being included into remote package feeds."
