#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8194
msgid ":term:`QB_DEFAULT_KERNEL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8197
msgid ""
"When using ``runqemu``, the :term:`QB_DEFAULT_KERNEL` variable controls "
"the default Linux kernel image to boot, found in "
":term:`DEPLOY_DIR_IMAGE`. For example: ``bzImage``."
msgstr ""

