msgid ":term:`QB_DRIVE_TYPE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8203
msgid ""
"When using ``runqemu``, the :term:`QB_DRIVE_TYPE` variable specifies the "
"type of drive to emulate when starting the emulated machine. Valid values"
" are:"
