#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8219
msgid ":term:`QB_KERNEL_CMDLINE_APPEND`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8222
msgid ""
"The :term:`QB_KERNEL_CMDLINE_APPEND` variable controls the options passed"
