"The :term:`QB_MEM` variable controls the amount of memory allocated to "
"the emulated machine. Specify as follows::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8236
msgid ":term:`QB_NETWORK_DEVICE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8239
msgid ""
"When using ``runqemu``, the :term:`QB_NETWORK_DEVICE` variable controls "
"the network device instantiated by QEMU. This value needs to be "
"compatible with the :term:`QB_TAP_OPT` variable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8247
msgid "``runqemu`` replaces ``@MAC@`` with a predefined mac address."
