#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8248
msgid ":term:`QB_NFSROOTFS_EXTRA_OPT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8251
msgid ""
"When using ``runqemu``, the :term:`QB_NFSROOTFS_EXTRA_OPT` variable "
