#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8258
msgid ":term:`QB_OPT_APPEND`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8261
msgid ""
"When using ``runqemu``, the :term:`QB_OPT_APPEND` variable controls "
"general options to append to QEMU when starting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8263
msgid ":term:`QB_RNG`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8266
msgid ""
"When using ``runqemu``, the :term:`QB_RNG` variable controls pass-through"
" for host random number generator, it can speedup boot in system mode, "
"where system is experiencing entropy starvation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8273
msgid ":term:`QB_ROOTFS_EXTRA_OPT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8276
msgid ""
"When using ``runqemu``, the :term:`QB_ROOTFS_EXTRA_OPT` variable controls"
" extra options to be appended to the rootfs device options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8278
msgid ":term:`QB_SERIAL_OPT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8281
msgid ""
"When using ``runqemu``, the :term:`QB_SERIAL_OPT` variable controls the "
"serial port option."
