#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8287
msgid ":term:`QB_SMP`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8290
msgid ""
"When using ``runqemu``, the :term:`QB_SMP` variable controls amount of "
"CPU cores made available inside the QEMU guest, each mapped to a thread "
"on the host."
