#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8302
msgid ":term:`QB_TAP_OPT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8305
msgid ""
"When using ``runqemu``, the :term:`QB_TAP_OPT` variable controls the "
"network option for \"tap\" mode."
