#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8904
msgid ":term:`SBOM_CVE_CHECK_EXTRA_ARGS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8906
msgid ""
"When inheriting the :ref:`ref-classes-sbom-cve-check` class, this "
"variable can be used to pass extra arguments to the ``sbom-cve-check`` "
"command-line tool."
