#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8920
msgid "``target`` (default): recipes are scanned in their target context"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8921
msgid "``native``: recipes are scanned in their :ref:`ref-classes-native` context"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:8922
msgid ""
"``both``: recipes are scanned in both their target and :ref:`ref-classes-"
"native` context"
