msgid ":term:`SDK_POSTPROCESS_COMMAND`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:9102
msgid ""
"Specifies a list of functions to call once the OpenEmbedded build system "
"creates the SDK. You can specify functions separated by spaces:"
