msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:9194
msgid ":term:`SDK_VERSION`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:9196
msgid ""
"Specifies the version of the SDK. The Poky distribution configuration "
"file (``/meta-poky/conf/distro/poky.conf``) sets the default "
":term:`SDK_VERSION` as follows::"
