#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:9202
msgid ""
"For additional information, see the :term:`DISTRO_VERSION` and "
":term:`METADATA_REVISION` variables."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:9205
msgid ":term:`SDK_ZIP_OPTIONS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:9207
msgid ""
"Specifies extra options to pass to the ``zip`` command when zipping the "
"SDK (i.e. when :term:`SDK_ARCHIVE_TYPE` is set to \"zip\"). The default "
"value is \"-y\"."
