#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:9276
msgid ""
"The :term:`SELECTED_OPTIMIZATION` variable takes the value of "
":term:`FULL_OPTIMIZATION` unless :term:`DEBUG_BUILD` = \"1\", in which "
"case the value of :term:`DEBUG_OPTIMIZATION` is used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:9279 ../../ref-manual/varlocality.rst:55
msgid ":term:`SERIAL_CONSOLES`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:9281
msgid ""
"Defines a serial console (TTY) to enable using :wikipedia:`getty "
"<Getty_(Unix)>`. Provide a value that specifies the baud rate followed by"
" the TTY device name separated by a semicolon. Use spaces to separate "
"multiple devices::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:9287
