msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:9607
msgid ""
"A space-separated list of Python regular expressions used to exclude "
"files from the SPDX output when :term:`SPDX_INCLUDE_SOURCES` is enabled. "
"Files whose paths match any of the patterns, via ``re.search()``, are "
