msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:9936
msgid ""
"The namespace used for generating UUIDs in SPDX documents. This should be"
" a domain name or unique identifier for your organization to ensure "
"globally unique SPDX IDs across different builds and organizations."
