"Options for the device tree compiler passed to ``mkimage -D`` feature "
"while creating a FIT image with the :ref:`ref-classes-uboot-sign` class. "
"If :term:`SPL_MKIMAGE_DTCOPTS` is not set then the :ref:`ref-classes-"
"uboot-sign` class will not pass the ``-D`` option to ``mkimage``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ref-manual/variables.rst:9997
msgid ""
"The default value is set to \"\" by the :ref:`ref-classes-uboot-config` "
"class."
