"The name of keys used by the :ref:`ref-classes-uboot-sign` class for "
"signing U-Boot FIT image stored in the :term:`SPL_SIGN_KEYDIR` directory."
" If we have for example a ``dev.key`` key and a ``dev.crt`` certificate "
"stored in the :term:`SPL_SIGN_KEYDIR` directory, you will have to set "
