"build-time dependencies. The :term:`WKS_FILE_DEPENDS` variable is only "
"applicable when Wic images are active (i.e. when :term:`IMAGE_FSTYPES` "
"contains entries related to Wic). If your recipe does not create Wic "
"images, the variable has no effect."
